write(T,'Financial Assumptions.txt','''FICTIONAL FINANCIAL EXERCISE\nAll amounts are UGX and exclude any separately assessed tax. Period September 2026. INV-003 appears twice because of a deliberate import duplicate, not a second sale.\nRaw import 125,000,000. Unique invoices 100,000,000. Credit note 2,000,000. Net teaching sales and ledger 98,000,000. Receipts against those teaching sales 80,000,000. Outstanding 18,000,000, assuming no opening balances, other timing differences, allocations or adjustments.\nSupporting identifiers are teaching labels, not valid TINs or FDNs. One is absent to prompt an evidence request.\nThis exercise establishes no tax rate, tax liability, filing obligation or compliance opinion. Actual work needs the relevant records, facts and current authority.''')
